32i/1520129._UY200_CR1,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":34,"textReviewsCount":841,"name":"Christina","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/1520129-christina","contributor":null,"id":1520129},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3P57VCW0XNTHM":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3P57VCW0XNTHM"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3P57VCW0XNTHM\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.YkdkB1vQCtermeAh\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3P57VCW0XNTHM","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3P57VCW0XNTHM"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.YkdkB1vQCtermeAh","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.YkdkB1vQCtermeAh"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/1520129?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3224490923"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.r2pFxajYKFyQQ7uAhMdX_A":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.r2pFxajYKFyQQ7uAhMdX_A","creator":{"__ref":"User:1520129"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1588469926535,"createdAt":1583780697713,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1583780993552,"text":"\u003cstrong\u003e4.5 Stars Great Romantic Suspense\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eYou can never go wrong with a novel by the talented Traci Hunter Abramson. She really knows her stuff and does extensive research when writing a novel, and it shows in her attention to detail and plot buildup. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved this princess and bodyguard storyline. It helps if you’ve read the books in her “Royal” series, as you understand more of the characters and their histories better, but you don’t have to read those beforehand. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved the suspense and mystery in this book, and the romance was clean and sweet as well. Towards the end I couldn’t put it down- the suspense was killing me and I HAD to know what would happen. It was another great read by this author, and I hope we see more books like this one soon!","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3P57VCW0XNTHM\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.YkdkB1vQCtermeAh\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:1256966":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":1256966,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1776399689i/1256966._UX200_CR0,31,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":55,"textReviewsCount":1523,"name":"Sheila (sheilasbookreviewer)","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/1256966-sheila-sheilasbookreviewer","contributor":null,"id":1256966},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1GEENO1DGD2UH":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1GEENO1DGD2UH"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1GEENO1DGD2UH\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1GEENO1DGD2UH","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1GEENO1DGD2UH"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/1256966?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3049569084"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.0QsFgtqHL31YQ4WpyBlyNg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.0QsFgtqHL31YQ4WpyBlyNg","creator":{"__ref":"User:1256966"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1584832254290,"createdAt":1584683788008,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1584683823158,"text":"I literally love everything Traci Hunter Abramson has written. She has written many different series and Royal Heir is book 4 in \"The Royals\". It's been a few years since book 3 was released, so I was very thrilled when I knew this book was coming out. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI love reading books about royalty and this series is about contemporary royalty. What little girl doesn't dream at one time or another of being a princess? In Royal Heir, the story revolves around Princess Cassandra of Sereno. Someday she will be the Queen of her country, but after an assassination attempt, her father King Alejandro sends her away to a neighboring country for protection. There Cassandra meets CIA agent Levi Marin. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI really loved how Cassandra, or Cassie as Levi calls her, pretended to be Levi's girlfriend as she hides out in Meridia. Levi's goal is to try and find out who wants Cassie dead while trying to protect his own heart. Cassie tries to pretend but soon sees that she's falling in love with Levi, a commoner. Even though the reader can see the writing on the wall, it's fun to see how Cassie and Levi navigate these dangerous waters and work hard at keeping Cassie and her family safe. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI love how the beautiful Mediterranean is detailed so breathtakingly. You feel like you are there walking the sandy beaches and smelling the salty ocean water. The one thing that isn't totally clear is why the unrest in Serano is happening and how it will all fall out. Royal Heir is truly a mix of intense action, forbidden romance, and an exciting culmination that you might not see coming. This clean romantic suspense will make a good read for upper teens and adults. It can be read as a stand-alone, but as always I recommend you read books 1-3 in the series first. ","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1GEENO1DGD2UH\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:61467138":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":61467138,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1632895615i/61467138._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2,"textReviewsCount":530,"name":"Charity Jacob","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/61467138-charity-jacob","contributor":null,"id":61467138},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2EDQE1UWX5TT9":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EDQE1UWX5TT9"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EDQE1UWX5TT9\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2EDQE1UWX5TT9","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EDQE1UWX5TT9"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/61467138?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3182625246"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.93831a2CZzcDv1vCZE4EGA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.93831a2CZzcDv1vCZE4EGA","creator":{"__ref":"User:61467138"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1583305514541,"createdAt":1583012683515,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1583012695844,"text":"The following is my honest review of an advanced copy I was given of Royal Heir by Traci Hunter Abramson:\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI’ve been waiting a really long time to read this book. Ever since I read the author’s Royal series which includes Royal Target, Royal Secrets, and Royal Brides I’ve been wanting to see the character Levi Marin get his own happily ever after story. Traci has finally made my desires happen and she did not disappoint me. In fact, according to the author, this book is going to be a start of a brand new world she is creating. I can’t wait to see what happens next.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThough Royal Heir is a start of a new world, you still got to see some old friends in this book which made my heart happy. After all, you can’t have a royal book without the dashing Prince Garrett and the heroic Princess Janessa of Meridia.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis book is full of adventure, suspense, and some romance. All three great elements to make a great read. You are going to fall in love all over again as you get to know Levi Marin and Princess Cassandra (Cassie) of Sereno. You will not be disappointed with this read. I highly recommend this book to all suspense and romance readers.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EDQE1UWX5TT9\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:43859995":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":43859995,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1,"textReviewsCount":34,"name":"Kristin Peterson","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/43859995-kristin-peterson","contributor":null,"id":43859995},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2Z3K2V4G8QHT2":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Z3K2V4G8QHT2"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Z3K2V4G8QHT2\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2Z3K2V4G8QHT2","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Z3K2V4G8QHT2"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/43859995?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3206791229"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.LoVlYcWCB76Z0hkBFqI3AQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.LoVlYcWCB76Z0hkBFqI3AQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:43859995"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1583305510119,"createdAt":1582669405691,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1582669511421,"text":"Traci Hunter Abramson is continuing her Royal series with Royal Heir. This is a new royal family but some characters are familiar. It can be a stand alone book, but if you've read the first books you will find a deeper character development.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI enjoyed this book (I'm one reader who hasn't read the first books) and definitely loved how the romance part was throughout the book. You learn who the guilty party is near the beginning of the book but the mystery lies in why he committed the crime and how he will accomplish what he has set out to do.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere are secrets and responsibilities that keep coming between Cassie and Levi's growing attraction. They are conflicted as to where their relationship is going to go, and Levi keeps trying to distance himself only to keep coming back not only because of his feelings but his sense of duty to protect Cassie.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTraci knows how to write a suspense/mystery/romance and keep the reader reading. I started this book knowing that there were previous books in the series and there would be parts of the story that would be more familiar had I read the other books first. I found that while it would be nice to know that background story it wasn't necessary. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIt's a clean romance with a great mystery and suspense, it also shows great character development and conflict. I would recommend this novel to anyone who loves a great suspense with a wonderful love story. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI was given access to an advanced copy, all opinions are my own.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Z3K2V4G8QHT2\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:5898760":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":5898760,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1327951170i/5898760._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":41,"textReviewsCount":806,"name":"Crystal (Books Are Sanity!!!)","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/5898760-crystal-books-are-sanity","contributor":null,"id":5898760},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A35XRN99V1WB0Y":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A35XRN99V1WB0Y"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A35XRN99V1WB0Y\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A35XRN99V1WB0Y","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A35XRN99V1WB0Y"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/5898760?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"arc","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/5898760?shelf=arc"}},{"__typename":"Tag