 in the best way and I enjoyed the twists at the end of the story. \u003cbr /\u003eI lost sleep staying up to finish the end of the book it was just that good. I definitely recommend this novel.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1XGMS7MN9YW86\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"Contributor:kca://author/amzn1.gr.author.v1.Wljk8hGMWgllzOwHYN_zUA":{"__typename":"Contributor","id":"kca://author/amzn1.gr.author.v1.Wljk8hGMWgllzOwHYN_zUA","works":{"__typename":"ContributorWorksConnection","totalCount":41}},"User:2202257":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":2202257,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1768581171i/2202257._UX200_CR0,52,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":true,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1162,"textReviewsCount":11,"name":"Sian","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/2202257-sian","contributor":{"__ref":"Contributor:kca://author/amzn1.gr.author.v1.Wljk8hGMWgllzOwHYN_zUA"},"id":2202257},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A114YO816MQCRR":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A114YO816MQCRR"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A114YO816MQCRR\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A114YO816MQCRR","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A114YO816MQCRR"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.3JFAhashUFaPcUC-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2202257?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3247172625"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads